-- title:
--   Ramified principal series has no GL₂(ℤₚ)-fixed vector
-- statement:
--   Let $p$ be a prime and let $\mu_1,\mu_2 \colon \mathbb{Q}_p^\times \to \mathbb{C}^\times$ be group homomorphisms. Assume that at least one of them fails to be unramified in the sense of [`LocalNewvector.IsUnramified`](def/LocalNewvector_CharConductor.html#L11), i.e. that for at least one index $i$ there exists $u \in \mathbb{Q}_p^\times$ with $\|u\| = 1$ and $\mu_i(u) \neq 1$. The conclusion concerns the space [`LocalNewvector.PSCarrier p μ₁ μ₂`](def/LocalNewvector_PrincipalSeriesCarrier.html#L173), the type underlying the $\mathbb{C}$-submodule of functions $f \colon \mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Q}_p) \to \mathbb{C}$ that are locally constant and satisfy the Borel transformation rule $f(\mathrm{borelElem}\,(a_1,a_2,x)\cdot g) = \mu_1(a_1)\,\mu_2(a_2)\,\delta^{1/2}(a_1,a_2)\, f(g)$ for all $a_1,a_2 \in \mathbb{Q}_p^\times$, $x \in \mathbb{Q}_p$ and $g \in \mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Q}_p)$, with `halfModulus` as the normalising factor. The assertion is that the submodule of vectors of this space fixed by every element of [`LocalNewvector.padicK1 p 0`](def/LocalNewvector_CongruenceSubgroupK1.html#L161) is the zero submodule. Here `padicK1 p 0` is `congruenceK1 (p : ℤ_[p]) 0`, the subgroup of $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Q}_p)$ consisting of images of matrices $y \in \mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Z}_p)$ whose entries $y_{10}$ and $y_{11} - 1$ lie in the ideal generated by $p^0 = 1$; the two congruence conditions are therefore vacuous, and the group in question is the full maximal compact subgroup $\mathrm{GL}_2(\mathbb{Z}_p)$.
--
--   This is one half of Casselman's spherical-line dichotomy at conductor exponent $0$: a principal series $B(\mu_1,\mu_2)$ contains a nonzero spherical vector only when both characters are unramified. It is used in the bound on the local conductor of an adelic lift, where the nonvanishing of a map out of the principal series carrier forces $p^2$ to divide the level.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_LocalNewvector_PSCarrier_fixedSubmodule_padicK1_zero_eq_bot.lean

